      "id": 1,
      "text": "North Bethesda began as 17th‑century settlements along Rock Creek and the Seneca Trail, with early land grants named “Dan” and “Leeke Forest.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
